Z||000000||Wannabe||04-22-2001||11:53 AM||||Unbelieveable sometime how things work out. I sold the '87 Blue GT aout a month ago after having it sitting in the garage for most of the last year. It was sad to see it go, but time just didn't permit getting around to doing all the work it needed. After searching for a suitable '88 for months (even before selling the GT) I was about ready to give up on the whole thing. Luck was on my side though, and I just found a very clean '88 Formula with low miles (50k!) and made a great deal for it. Ready to run and all! It was the classic story of a great, underused car sitting in a garage in the country!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> ||||reg||1
